<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
  <title>Join the Order</title>
  
  <%- include("partials/metadata") %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head> <body>
  <%- include("partials/header") %>



<main>
<section class="about-section">

<div class="about-inner">



<h1 class="about-title">Answer the Bell</h1>

<hr class="order-rule">





<p class="about-text">
</p>

<p class="about-text">
The Order of the Lion's Bell welcomes all
 sincere seekers who feel drawn toward awakening, 
 philosophical inquiry, and the pursuit of truth.
</p>

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

<p class="about-text">
The Order of the Lion's Bell is founded on the principle that 
all seekers stand equal in dignity and potential.
The Order recognizes no distinction of
birth, wealth, nationality, gender, or social status.
</p>

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>


<p class="about-text">
Men and women of every background may approach the Order, 
for the search for knowledge belongs to all humanity.
<span class="accent">
However, entry into the fellowship of the Order is not granted lightly.</span>
</p>

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>


<p class="about-text">
Those who wish to approach the Order are first 
asked to study its doctrine and moral virtues.
Membership in the Order is not understood as status or authority,
 but as a commitment to study, reflection, and the proclamation of knowledge 
 once it has been discovered.
</p>

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

<p class="about-text">
The Order does make use of symbolic titles and stages of progression. 
These are not ranks of authority or superiority, 
but markers of understanding and commitment along the path of study.
Each stage reflects a deeper engagement with the teachings
of the Order and a greater responsibility to preserve and
proclaim knowledge.
</p>


<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>


<p class="about-text">
The Order of the Lion's Bell   
<span class="accent"> does not require payment 
for entry or study. </span> The pursuit of knowledge is considered a 
universal human calling, and access to the teachings of the Order is
offered freely to sincere seekers.
</p>

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

<p class="about-text">
Those who feel drawn to this path are invited to study the doctrine of the
Order and submit a request for correspondence. 

<div class="divider-symbol">✶✶</div>

<p class="about-quote">
        apply@heraldsofthelion.org
</p>










</div>

</section>
</main>







